   "SideCal by Kacper Górec. Open source under the <a href=\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\">Apache License 2.0</a>. Product names and logos belong to their respective owners.": "SideCal par Kacper Górec. Open source sous <a href=\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\">licence Apache 2.0</a>. Les noms de produits et logos appartiennent à leurs propriétaires respectifs.",
   "<a href=\"documentation.html\">Documentation</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/kacpergorec/sidecal/releases\">Releases</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/kacpergorec/sidecal\">GitHub</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/kacpergorec/sidecal/issues\">Report an issue</a>": "<a href=\"documentation.html\">Documentation</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/kacpergorec/sidecal/releases\">Versions</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/kacpergorec/sidecal\">GitHub</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/kacpergorec/sidecal/issues\">Signaler un problème</a>",
